<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy — ttraces.io</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/style.css">
  <script src="/assets/js/app.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <a href="/" class="wordmark">ttraces<span>.io</span></a>
    <nav>
      <a href="/">FEED</a>
      <a href="/news/">NEWS</a>
      <a href="/research/">RESEARCH</a>
      <a href="/trends/">TRENDS</a>
      <a href="/privacy/" class="active">PRIVACY</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section>
      <span class="brand-label">ZERO-TRACKING ARCHITECTURE</span>
      <h1 style="margin-top: 8px;">Privacy Transparency Model</h1>

      <div class="route-line"></div>

      <div style="background-color: var(--color-substrate); border: 1px solid var(--color-wire); padding: 32px; max-width: 800px;">
        <h2>Non-Negotiable Guarantees</h2>
        <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 16px; color: var(--color-path-grey);">
          <li><strong>0 Cookies & Trackers:</strong> No advertising scripts, analytics beacons, or third-party cookies.</li>
          <li><strong>0 User Credentials:</strong> No login passwords, tokens, API keys, or email harvesting.</li>
          <li><strong>100% Client-Side Preferences:</strong> Filter state and liked items are stored exclusively in browser <code>localStorage</code>.</li>
          <li><strong>Static Link Sharing:</strong> Redirects use deterministic static pages (<code>/s/&lt;id&gt;/</code>) without click-tracking APIs.</li>
          <li><strong>Deterministic Metadata Extraction:</strong> No LLM/AI APIs or external data processors.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>TTRACES.IO — BRAND SYSTEM V1.0 · ZERO-TRACKING PUBLIC FEED</div>
  </footer>
